<title>POLAND: VISTULA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 1.4.</title>
<headline>VISTULA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 1.4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.44 vs   0.95</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.21 vs   2.03</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.78 vs   1.60</p>
<p> Sales		   10.93 vs   8.88</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.38 vs   5.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.52 vs   8.58</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.01 vs   5.52</p>
<p> Sales		   39.44 vs  33.64</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Vistula SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
